Name: TweetNaCl
Short Name: tweetnacl
URL: https://tweetnacl.cr.yp.to/
Version: 20140427
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: Public Domain
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
A compact implementation of the NaCl cryptography library. Used by
//components/pubky_session for XSalsa20-Poly1305 (crypto_secretbox_open),
which Pubky's bare grant approvals use and BoringSSL does not provide.

Local Modifications:
None to the sources. tweetnacl.c and tweetnacl.h are the 20140427 release
files (SHA-256 02e65bc3013ff2168983365e55906bc783c4c7e0a60d8100f17bb303a17175c4
and 43f29ad721d9927b747b0100ab4160c119e7bb180c7c98a66e4bf79d31244287).
BUILD.gn renames the randombytes hook to pubky_tweetnacl_randombytes, which
//components/pubky_session/core provides.
